<title>USA: CCC buys 25,470 tonnes U.S. spring wheat for Ghana.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 25,470 tonnes U.S. spring wheat for Ghana.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Department of Agriculture's Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 25,470 tonnes of dark northern spring wheat for donation to Ghana.</p>
<p>The wheat was due for May 1-25 shipment.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Peavey Co at $186.65 a tonne, FOB Paulina, La.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
